---
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../lib/config';
---

<footer class="footer sm:footer-horizontal bg-base-300 text-base-content p-10 mt-12">
  <div class="container mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">{SITE_CONFIG.name}</h3>
      <p class="text-sm mt-2">{SITE_CONFIG.description}</p>
      <p class="text-xs mt-4 opacity-60">
        本站部分链接为联盟链接，如果您通过这些链接购买产品，我们可能会获得佣金。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-md font-semibold mb-2">快速链接</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/tools" class="link link-hover">AI 工具目录</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog" class="link link-hover">教程文章</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about" class="link link-hover">关于我们</a></li>
        <li><a href="/submit" class="link link-hover">提交工具</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-md font-semibold mb-2">热门分类</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/categories/text" class="link link-hover">文本生成</a></li>
        <li><a href="/categories/image" class="link link-hover">图像生成</a></li>
        <li><a href="/categories/video" class="link link-hover">视频生成</a></li>
        <li><a href="/categories/code" class="link link-hover">编程助手</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container mx-auto mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-base-content/10 text-center text-xs opacity-60">
    <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} {SITE_CONFIG.name}. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
